.TH CONVT 1 "2026-10-04" "convt 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
convt \- convert files on this computer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B convt
.RI [ files ] " --to " format " [options]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Converts images, audio, video, PDF and documents locally.
Document conversions need an installed LibreOffice or a document pack.
Use --help for the complete command and option list.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B engines
List ready engines and explain unavailable engines.
.TP
.B targets FILE
List formats available for the input file.
.TP
.B formats
List known formats.
.TP
.B pack status
Show document pack availability without downloading anything.
.SH FILES
The installed payload and bundled libraries are under /opt/convt.
Per-user presets and document packs are retained when the package is removed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR convt-app (1)
